# 👨‍🍳 Claude Code Instructions (`shikamaru-kitchen`)

Read [`AGENTS.md`](./AGENTS.md), [`docs/INDEX.md`](./docs/INDEX.md), and [`.agents/rules/kitchen-protocol.md`](./.agents/rules/kitchen-protocol.md) before executing any task.

## Culinary Lifecycle Commands
- **`/menu`** (`.agents/skills/menu/SKILL.md`) — Design product menu, Signature Dishes vs. House Staples, and Taste System
- **`/prep`** (`.agents/skills/prep/SKILL.md`) — Automated *Mise en Place* & 0-Token Mechanical Architecture Linter setup
- **`/taste <NN-dish-slug>`** (`.agents/skills/taste/SKILL.md`) — Generate interactive 4-state Tasting Spoon (`preview.html`) & lock 3-Course recipe
- **`/cook <NN-dish-slug>`** (`.agents/skills/cook/SKILL.md`) — Cook Course 1 (Domain), Course 2 (Interactive UI), and Course 3 (Micro-Craft Seasoning)
- **`/plate <NN-dish-slug>`** (`.agents/skills/plate/SKILL.md`) — Run Food Safety + 4-Star Culinary Craft Audit + Browser Evidence & Serve
